S.A.T.). C.T.-L., K.P., E.F., E.T., K.R., O.B., H.Z. and S.A.T. are supported by the Wellcome Sanger Institute grant (WT206194) and the Wellcome Science Strategic Support for a Pilot for the Human Cell Atlas (WT211276/Z/18/Z)). J.G.S. and C.E.S. are supported by NIH grants (2R01HL080494, 2R01HL080494, 1UM1HL098166). J.G.S. and C.E.S. are supported by Engineering Research Centers Program of the National Science Foundation under NSF Cooperative Agreement no. EEC-1647837. C.E.S. and B.M. are supported by the Howard Hughes Medical Institute. We are grateful to the deceased donors and their families, the Human Organ Procurement and Exchange Program (HOPE) and to the Cambridge Biorepository for Translational Medicine (CBTM) for access to human tissue. E.R.N. was supported by a fellowship from the Sarnoff Cardiovascular Research Foundation."
